<section class="wrap section" id="pricing"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">03 / A SENSIBLE STARTING POINT</p><h2>Clear scope. Clear costs.</h2></div><p>Indicative planning ranges in Canadian dollars. Every engagement starts with a written scope and quote.</p></div><div class="pricing-grid"><article><p class="eyebrow">A FOCUSED FIRST STEP</p><h3>Technical review</h3><p class="price">$350–750 <small>CAD</small></p><p>A focused review of a website or Linux setup, with prioritized findings and practical next steps.</p><a href="#contact" class="text-link service-select" data-service="Technical review">Start with a review <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span></a></article><article class="featured-price"><p class="eyebrow">MAKE YOUR NEXT THING</p><h3>Custom development</h3><p class="price">$2,500–7,500+ <small>CAD</small></p><p>A small website, integration, or internal tool. Scope, complexity, and existing systems shape the final quote.</p><a href="#contact" class="text-link service-select" data-service="Custom development">Talk through your idea <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span></a></article><article><p class="eyebrow">KEEP THINGS IN GOOD ORDER</p><h3>Ongoing care</h3><p class="price">From $180 <small>/ month</small></p><p>A scoped maintenance plan for agreed updates, checks, and small improvements. Support hours agreed in advance.</p><a href="#contact" class="text-link service-select" data-service="Ongoing care">Discuss a care plan <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span></a></article></div><p class="pricing-note">Planning estimates, not binding offers. Applicable taxes, hosting, third-party fees, and emergency coverage are quoted separately. No 24/7 support is implied.</p></section>
